@@title CQ-SNP Sack pickup client half, 2026-11-21 (same section)
@@date 2026-11-21
@@jars creativecompat
@@sources feature_writeup/storage_audit.md
@@text
@@table
## CQ-SNP-01 | hand: tooltip of a picked-up sack, the screen opens without sneaking, another team's FTB Chunks claim
@group client
@commands survival in a client: fill a sack with 3 kinds, sneak right-click it empty-handed, hover the item; right-click a placed sack without sneaking; on a dedicated server with a second player's FTB Chunks claim, sneak right-click a sack inside it
@pass the tooltip lists the 3 kinds; the unsneaked click opens the sack's screen; in the foreign claim nothing happens and the sack stays
@fails Supplementaries' sack tooltip reads `BlockEntityTag`; `SneakPickup` must leave the unsneaked click alone; FTB Chunks cancels the `BreakEvent`
@draft needs a real client (the claim half needs two players on a dedicated server): a hand check unless the runner writes driver steps for the first two

@@section 3
@@title SQ-SNP sack sneak pick-up moved to Creative Compat, 2026-11-24 ([storage_audit.md](../storage_audit.md) 7; TODO `creative-common-publish #17`)
@@date 2026-11-24
@@jars creativecompat
@@sources feature_writeup/storage_audit.md development/creativeCompat/src/main/java/com/SaintAlfonzo/creativecompat/storage/SneakPickup.java
@@text Same checks as section 1 on the Compat jar; the tag is `#creativecompat:sneak_pickup`. Rows SQ-SNP-01 to -05 above were retargeted to the new tag and jar.
@@table
## SQ-SNP-06 | Compat without Common's script: tag filled from Compat's own server script, pickup works
@group B (Compat + Supplementaries)
@commands boot Compat with Supplementaries and the sacks; `/cdevtest tag block creativecompat:sneak_pickup`; rerun SQ-SNP-01
@pass the tag lists `supplementaries:sack`; sneak right-click with an empty hand gives the sack with its contents; `creativecommon:sneak_pickup` does not exist
@fails `kubejs/data/creativecompat/kubejs/tags/sneak_pickup_tags.js` not loaded; `SneakPickup` registration in `CreativeCompat.java`
@absent creativecompat:sneak_pickup creativecommon:sneak_pickup (tag added 2026-11-24; the old one must be empty)
@modset cpp_chain compat +supplementaries-* +moonlight-* +suppsquared-*
# r1124gate (2026-11-24, runner-4): Common + Compat (+ Calendar, Serene Seasons) plus Supplementaries and Squared; the
# set's kubejs/ holds only the probes, so the tag can come only from the script in Compat's jar
# (data/creativecompat/kubejs/tags/sneak_pickup_tags.js). SQ-SNP-01 moved to group B, y 200 over the world.
shell ls kubejs/server_scripts; ! grep -rl "sneak_pickup" kubejs/server_scripts
shell unzip -l mods/creativecompat-*.jar | grep "kubejs/tags/sneak_pickup_tags.js"
> forceload add 5360 5200 5375 5215
sleep 3
> fill 5360 199 5200 5375 199 5215 minecraft:stone
> fill 5360 200 5200 5375 204 5215 minecraft:air
sleep 2
> cdevtest tag block creativecompat:sneak_pickup
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativecompat:sneak_pickup n=\d+ ids=(?=\S*supplementaries:sack\b)(?=\S*suppsquared:sack_red\b)
> cdevtest tag block creativecommon:sneak_pickup
expect verb=tag kind=block tag=creativecommon:sneak_pickup n=0 ids=-
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item,x=5363,y=200,z=5203,distance=..8]
> setblock 5363 200 5203 supplementaries:sack{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:apple",Count:3b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:stick",Count:5b},{Slot:2b,id:"minecraft:cobblestone",Count:7b}]}
> pbot spawn snp6 5363.5 200 5205.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> pbot inv snp6 clear
> pbot sneak snp6 on
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=pbot\.sneak bot=snp6 shift=true
> pbot use snp6 5363 200 5203 up
sleep 1
> execute if block 5363 200 5203 minecraft:air run say SNP06 sack picked up
expect SNP06 sack picked up
> data get entity snp6 SelectedItem
expect snp6 has the following entity data: \{.*id: "supplementaries:sack"(?=.*minecraft:apple)(?=.*minecraft:stick)(?=.*minecraft:cobblestone)
> cdevtest items 5363 200 5203 2 keep
expect verb=items items=-
> pbot sneak snp6 off
> pbot use snp6 5363 199 5207 up
sleep 1
> cdevtest inv 5363 200 5207
expect verb=inv slot=\d+ item=minecraft:apple\*3\b
expect verb=inv slot=\d+ item=minecraft:stick\*5\b
expect verb=inv slot=\d+ item=minecraft:cobblestone\*7\b
> pbot remove snp6
> forceload remove 5360 5200 5375 5215
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|Invalid (block state|tag))
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
